There is (sort of) a way to get immunity from xans.
They only reduce your carrying capacity a bit, so just use up a few
unneccessary items (scrolls of genocide, wands of wishing, eggs) and
proceed on your way without worrying.  You lose carrying points for
each leg that is pricked, but you only have two legs to prick, so
don't waste so much effort trying to avoid those wimpy little xans.

